spans.s:
āloka, m. (once nt.), light, as in Skt.;
(1) fig., see dharmāloka (-mukha); like this, -jñānālokamukha Gv 〔169.24〕, introduction to the light of knowledge; -pratibhānālokamukha Gv 〔174.13—14〕; (prajñā udapāsi) ālokaṃ (n. sg. nt.) prādur-abhūṣi Mv 〔iii.332.15〕 illumination (of the mind) became manifested (virtually = enlightenment, true knowledge);
(2) m., a high number: Gv 〔133.13〕 (= aloka, q.v.). See the following items.
